# AGENTS.md
# CLAUDE.md
.antigravitycli/*
secrets/
frontend/coverage
# examples/ moved to corpus/examples (in the manga-tl-corpus submodule) — it is the source
# every corpus is derived from, so it now lives beside them. Gitignored there too, and it
# must stay that way: third-party copyrighted scans, some of it adult content.
.coverage
pytest*
exported_minio/*
exported_images/*

# Benchmark corpora and run output now live in the manga-tl-corpus submodule at corpus/.
# They are derived from examples/ (gitignored and purged from history here), so they have no
# source this repo can track — but they are still worth versioning, because ground truth is
# expensive and a silent change to it is exactly the kind of regression that is otherwise
# invisible. Hence: versioned, separately. See corpus/README.md and docs/benchmarks_guide.md §5.
# The durable role/provenance record stays here: corpus/scripts/examples_manifest.json.
# Papers and research reports live in docs/ for reading, but are not tracked: this repo is
# public, and third-party papers are not ours to redistribute. Cite the DOI in the doc instead.
docs/*.pdf
corpus/.claude
scripts/corpus
docs/reference/mask-eval-candidates-2026-08-26.png
backend/*

# There is now a package.json at the repo root, holding exactly one dependency: playwright, for
# scripts/playwright/*.cjs. Node resolves `require("playwright")` upward from the script, so the
# install has to land here rather than in frontend/. Committed so the corpus run is reproducible;
# the tree it installs is not.
node_modules/
